<title>LIECHTENSTEIN: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>LIECHTENSTEIN GOVERNMENT LIST (970311)</p>
<p>  ************************************************************</p>
<p>  * 10 Mar 97 - The Progressive Citizens Party Liechtenstein *</p>
<p>  *		 voted to split from its coalition partner of *</p>
<p>  *		 nearly 60 years, the Fatherland Union.	 *</p>
<p>  ************************************************************</p>
<p>  Head of State............................Prince HANS ADAM II</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>COALITION GOVERNMENT (Formed 15 Dec 93)</p>
<p>  Head of Government..........................Mario FRICK (VU)</p>
<p>  (Responsible for Justice, Finance)</p>
<p>  Deputy Head of Government...............Thomas BUECHEL (FBP)</p>
<p>  (Responsible for Environment, Agriculture and</p>
<p>				 Forestry, Education and Home Affairs)</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p>  Construction, Transport...............Cornelia GASSNER (FBP)</p>
<p>  Economics, Social Affairs, Health........Michael RITTER (VU)</p>
<p>  Foreign Affairs, Culture, Youth &amp; Sport....Andrea WILLI (VU)</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>PARTY AFFILIATIONS:</p>
<p>  FBP -- Progressive Citizens' Party Liechtenstein</p>
<p>	  (Fortschrittliche Burgerpartei)</p>
<p>  VU  -- Fatherland Union (Vaterlandische Union)</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>  State Bank Chairman...........................Karlheinz HEEB</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>	 NOTE: Any comments/queries on the content of this</p>
<p>		 government list, please contact the Reuter</p>
<p>		 Editorial Reference Unit, London, on (171) 542</p>
<p>		 7968.</p>
<p>		     (End Government List)</p>
</text>
